tutorial-step-welcome = Welcome to the station! Controls: WASD — move, Z — swap hand, LMB — pick up/use, Shift+LMB — examine. Go pick up your ID card.
tutorial-step-pick-up-id = Pick up the trainee ID card with left mouse button.
tutorial-step-insert-id-and-pda = Put the ID card into the PDA (click card on PDA), then put the PDA into the ID slot on your inventory.
tutorial-step-go-to-service = You now have Maintenance access. Walk to the marker in the service hallway.
tutorial-step-enter-dirty-hall = Yikes, this place is filthy. Time to clean it. Head into the janitor's closet — you have the access now.
tutorial-step-grab-trashbag = Grab a trashbag. Any of them works.
tutorial-step-collect-all-trash = Collect every piece of trash. Click the bag on trash or on the floor — it'll sweep the area. Q drops what you're holding.
tutorial-step-dispose-bag = Dispose of the bag in any disposal unit. Click the bag on the unit, then hit Flush. When you're done, click the button below.
tutorial-step-grab-bucket = Grab the bucket.
tutorial-step-fill-bucket = Holding the bucket, click the water tank to fill it.
tutorial-step-fill-trolley = Now click the bucket on the janitorial trolley to pour the water in.
tutorial-step-grab-mop = Grab the mop.
tutorial-step-pull-trolley = Swap to your other hand (Z), then pull the trolley behind you (Ctrl+LMB).
tutorial-step-clean-puddles = Clean every puddle. Click the mop on them, and re-wet it in the trolley now and then. When you're done, click the button below.
tutorial-step-finish-cleaning = Nice work! Stash the stuff back in the closet if you want. When you're ready to move on, click the button below — the service door will open.

tutorial-step-go-to-kitchen = Time for something tastier — the kitchen. You now have Kitchen access. Walk to the marker.
tutorial-step-go-to-freezer = Step into the freezer — that's where the meat spike is.
tutorial-step-get-meat = Open the pig crate (click it). Then kill the piglet and drag it onto the spike with the mouse to butcher it. Hit the button when done.
tutorial-step-cook-sausage-bread = Open the Guidebook (F1 or the icon on the right) → Kitchen → Sausage Bread. Make dough by the recipe, combine with meat, microwave it for 15 seconds. Click the button when done.

tutorial-step-go-to-bar = Off to the bar! You have access now. Walk behind the counter.
tutorial-step-learn-bar = This is where you make drinks. Glasses from VendingMachineBooze, ingredients from BoozeDispenser and SodaDispenser. Recipes are in the Guidebook → Drinks. Mess around, then hit the button when you're done.

tutorial-step-go-to-medbay = Medbay needs you. You have Medical access — walk to the entrance.
tutorial-step-heal-patients = Four living, one corpse. Kits are colour-coded — or open the Guidebook and check the chems. Wrong meds can kill, and the corp likes someone to blame. Help will point you at the next patient.
tutorial-step-bag-corpses = Corpses don't stay in the hallway. Grab a body bag from the locker, bag the dead, and put them in the morgue.

tutorial-step-go-to-security = Last stop — security. You have access. Walk into the security hall.
tutorial-step-shooting-range = There's a VIS pistol and mags on the range. Load it, shoot the targets. Hit the button when you're done.
tutorial-step-arrest-practice = Zipties are in the box. Cuff a dummy (or a coworker if you find one). Then the button.

tutorial-step-finale = That's it for today. Nobody holds your hand on the real station. Click to hop back to the main server.

tutorial-bubble-acknowledge = Done
tutorial-bubble-help = Help
tutorial-bubble-guidebook = Guidebook
tutorial-bubble-exit = Exit
tutorial-redial-message = Connecting to the main server…

tutorial-help-brute = Red kit. Pull a brutepack / gauze and use it on { $name }. Don't give them burn cream.
tutorial-help-burn = Yellow kit. Ointment and kelotane / dermaline pills for { $name }.
tutorial-help-toxin = Green kit. Dylovene or charcoal for { $name }. Ipecac is for vomiting, not antidote — skip it.
tutorial-help-rad = Radiation kit. Hyronalin or potassium iodide for { $name }. Skip the phalanximine.
tutorial-help-done = The living ones are sorted. Corpse next — bag and morgue.
